  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Transformation path Gu Immortals mainly carry transformation path dao marks in their bodies.",
      "chapters": [
        1099
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_transformation",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s early strength path and transformation path dao marks come from his first earthly calamity, while his qi path marks at that time are the lifetime accumulation of Qi Zai.",
      "chapters": [
        1066
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_qi_zai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Become Dragon Mound holds lots of transformation path dao marks. Living beings that stay there can transform into dragon beasts, and the site once produced many dragon Gu such as golden dragon Gu, water dragon Gu, and dragon breath Gu. Bai Ning Bing’s phantom aperture, given by Shadow Sect, can suppress those transformation path dao marks, restore a male body, and allow false immortal use of green grape immortal essence and Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1166
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dragon-transformation-site",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_become_dragon_mound",
        "gu_water_dragon_gu",
        "gu_dragon_breath_gu",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan can convert transformation path dao marks into light path dao marks temporarily when he needs more light path foundation.",
      "chapters": [
        1297
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "converting-into-other-paths",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transforming into a divination tortoise turns those marks into wisdom path dao marks and massively amplifies wisdom path methods: killing Wu Yi Hai and two immortals in the regional wall alone gave him close to fifty thousand transformation path dao marks, about fifty times amplification.",
      "chapters": [
        1310
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "converting-into-other-paths",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yi_hai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Beast Calamity grotto-heaven, temporary transformation path dao marks flood Fang Yuan’s body while his other dao marks change into transformation path dao marks. Transformation path can project every path, and those marks can transform into any path’s dao marks; the grotto-heaven’s method reverses that and turns other paths into transformation path instead.",
      "chapters": [
        1686
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "myriad-beings-assimilation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_beast_calamity_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Beast Calamity Immortal’s immortal killer move myriad beings assimilation transformation adds a great number of transformation path dao marks and also transforms the target’s other dao marks into transformation path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1690
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "myriad-beings-assimilation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
